sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Authenticated User
    participant Sidebar as Sidebar UI
    participant Store as Workspace Store
    participant BFF as Next.js BFF Server<br/>(/api/explorer)
    participant DB as Neon PostgreSQL<br/>(Prisma)

    %% Basic Flow
    User->>Sidebar: Click "New Folder" icon
    activate Sidebar
    Sidebar->>Store: dispatch(createFolder("New Folder"))
    activate Store
    Store->>BFF: POST /api/folders { name: "New Folder" }
    activate BFF
    BFF->>DB: Folder.create({ name: "New Folder" })
    activate DB
    DB-->>BFF: folderCreated
    deactivate DB
    BFF-->>Store: HTTP 200 OK (folder object)
    deactivate BFF
    Store-->>Sidebar: Update folder tree state
    Sidebar-->>User: Render "New Folder" at root
    deactivate Sidebar

    User->>Sidebar: Drag Note & drop into "New Folder"
    activate Sidebar
    Sidebar->>Sidebar: Check for cyclic moves (valid)
    Sidebar->>Store: dispatch(moveItem(noteId, folderId))
    Store->>BFF: PATCH /api/notes { id: noteId, folderId: folderId }
    activate BFF
    BFF->>DB: Note.update({ where: { id: noteId }, data: { folderId } })
    activate DB
    DB-->>BFF: noteUpdated
    deactivate DB
    BFF-->>Store: HTTP 200 OK
    deactivate BFF
    Store-->>Sidebar: Update tree nodes layout
    Sidebar-->>User: Display Note nested under folder
    deactivate Sidebar

    %% Alternative Flow
    User->>Sidebar: Drag Parent Folder into Child Folder
    activate Sidebar
    Sidebar->>Sidebar: run isDescendantFolder() check
    Note over Sidebar: Cyclic move detected
    Sidebar-->>User: Block drag-and-drop & show toast alert
    deactivate Sidebar
